/// Address-space invariants - the model-wide obligations of OPC UA Part 3 and Part 5 section 8.
///
/// `qa_remediation_plan.md` section 2.30 names this batch as R18's natural first: the `SVR-ADDRSP`
/// criteria are invariants over the whole address space rather than over one service call, so a
/// single walk discharges many of them. Each test below closes exactly one criterion and is named
/// after the obligation rather than after the mechanism.
///
/// The walk is breadth-first from Root over hierarchical references and is bounded - a conforming
/// server's model is finite, but a **non**-conforming one may contain the very loop
/// `AC-SVR-ADDRSP-153-HASCHILD-LOOP-FREE` forbids, and a harness that hangs reports nothing.

